dt-bindings: pwm: rockchip: add the RK3576 controller

RK3576 has a different register layout from the rk3328 generation, so it
gets its own compatible rather than a fallback. Like rk3328 it takes the
functional clock and the APB clock separately.

Signed-off-by: Isaiah DeRose-Wilson <isaiahdw@gmail.com>

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-rockchip.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/pwm-rockchip.yaml
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ properties:
       - const: rockchip,rk2928-pwm
       - const: rockchip,rk3288-pwm
       - const: rockchip,rk3328-pwm
+      - const: rockchip,rk3576-pwm
       - const: rockchip,vop-pwm
       - items:
           - const: rockchip,rk3036-pwm
@@ -66,6 +67,7 @@ allOf:
           contains:
             enum:
               - rockchip,rk3328-pwm
+              - rockchip,rk3576-pwm
               - rockchip,rv1108-pwm
 
     then:
